{"Shard filters multiplied - runShardSplitQuery() now pre-applies applyTemplateVariables(..., request.filters) and then calls runSplitQuery() per shard group, which again pre-applies applyTemplateVariables(..., request.filters) before executing via datasource.runQuery() (which applies it again). With ad-hoc filters enabled this can append the same label matchers multiple times and break or change queries.": 0.835711658000946}